# group|when|text
after||Open WebUI: the kit made its admin account (admin@localhost, with OPENWEBUI_ADMIN_PASSWORD from ~/server/kit/generated-secrets.conf); sign-ups are off. Change the password, turn on two-factor sign-in (your name, bottom left → Settings → Account), and add people under Admin Panel → Users.
before|EXPOSE_chat=funnel|Tailscale Funnel allowed for the kit's machines (for Open WebUI): admin console → Access controls → JSON editor: under "nodeAttrs", the entry with "attr": ["funnel"] (add {"target": ["autogroup:member"], "attr": ["funnel"]} if there is none), add "tag:server" to its "target" list (["autogroup:member"] alone leaves out tagged machines), then Save. Already done if you did it for Seerr or Jellyfin.
